        "claim": "RemoveFile deletes any file whose content becomes empty after the block is removed. A CLAUDE.md the owner had as an existing empty file before install is deleted on uninstall, so the pre-install state is not restored. blockFile.existed does not record whether install created the file, and an empty original file is indistinguishable from a created one.",
